<title>JAPAN: Sanshin Electronics up on healthy earnings.</title>
<headline>Sanshin Electronics up on healthy earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sanshin Electronics Co Ltd were higher in mid-morning trade on Thursday, lifted by healthy interim earnings, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares, which were the largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange, were up 80 yen at 1,550 yen as of 0135 GMT.  </p>
<p>The firm said it had parent current profits of 2.63 billion yen for the six months to September 30, up from 1.59 billion yen in year-ago period.</p>
